IMPORT `nd67-vn27-fund-art14-16`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Article 17: what the Motor Vehicle Insurance Fund pays, to whom, and
-- within what ceilings. Point (a) is the part a person harmed and an insurer can claim under:
-- humanitarian support where the insurance does not pay, and the repayment of an insurer's
-- advance. Points (b) to (h) are the other heads of spending and their ceilings; point (i) the
-- emergency use of the balance; clause 2 a priority.
-- DECREE 220/2026 does not amend Article 17, nor Article 6(1), 7(2) or 12(3)(b), to which it
-- refers (Decree 220 Article 9(1) changes the word for the third party in Article 7(1)(a)
-- only). The answer functions take the vintage and force it (`the answer in` v `, unamended
-- by Decree 220/2026:`, in the general module), so that every test runs under both and an
-- accident before Decree 67 is declined; no answer turns on which of the two it is.

§ `Article 17 — the content and rates of the Fund's spending`

-- src:492 | Điều 17. Nội dung và tỷ lệ chi của Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- src:493 | 1. Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới được sử dụng cho các mục đích sau:

§§ `Article 17(1)(a), first paragraph — humanitarian support`

-- Support is paid "in the cases" of: (1) a vehicle that caused the accident not identified;
-- (2) a vehicle not insured; (3) not within the scope of the insurance; (4) the exclusions of
-- Article 7(2), except the injured person's own intentional act. The amount, per person per
-- accident: 30% of the limit of Article 6(1) for a death and for an injury rate of 81% or more;
-- 10% for an injury rate from 31% to under 81%. Nothing below 31%.
-- Fork V6: "tử vong và tỷ lệ tổn thương từ 81% trở lên" is two cases (a death; a rate of 81%
--   or more), not both at once; a death has no injury rate (row VN-10 read Article 12(3)(b)'s
--   same words the same way, its F15).
-- Fork V7: the exception "(trừ hành động cố ý gây thiệt hại của người bị thiệt hại)" sits
--   inside the fourth case, after "khoản 2 Điều 7", and is read as limiting that case only. A
--   person harmed by an unidentified or uninsured vehicle is in case (1) or (2) whatever that
--   person intended (finding R4).
-- Fork V8: where several vehicles caused the harm, the person is in a case if any of them puts
--   the harm in one (an uninsured vehicle beside an insured one is still "xe không tham gia
--   bảo hiểm"); see finding R5.
-- Fork V9: the injury rate is the rate assessed for the person; the decree names no assessor
--   for the Fund. Article 12(3)(b) speaks of an ESTIMATED rate ("ước tính"); this paragraph
--   does not.
-- Fork V10: "không thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm" is read of the person's harm (the support is "cho
--   một người"): a person whose harm Article 7(1) does not reach is in case (3), even where the
--   accident harmed others who are covered (finding R2).
