-- src:497 | bảo hiểm theo quy định tại khoản 2 Điều 7 Nghị định này (trừ hành động cố ý gây
-- src:498 | thiệt hại của người bị thiệt hại) với mức hỗ trợ cụ thể như sau: 30% giới hạn trách
-- src:499 | nhiệm bảo hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn đối với trường
-- src:500 | hợp tử vong và tỷ lệ tổn thương từ 81% trở lên; 10% giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo
-- src:501 | hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn đối với trường hợp tỷ lệ
-- src:502 | tổn thương từ 31% đến dưới 81%.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 17(1)(a), first paragraph; forks V7, V10
GIVEN vehicle IS A `A vehicle that caused the harm`
GIVETH A MAYBE `A case of Article 17(1)(a)`
`Article 17(1)(a) — the case in which the harm is put by` vehicle MEANS
    CONSIDER vehicle
    WHEN `a vehicle that was not identified`                         THEN JUST `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`
    WHEN `an identified vehicle with no compulsory insurance in force` THEN JUST `the vehicle was not insured`
    WHEN `an identified, insured vehicle, whose insurer answers` answer THEN
        CONSIDER answer
        WHEN `the insurer covers the harm`                              THEN NOTHING
        WHEN `the harm is outside the scope of Article 7(1)`            THEN JUST `the harm is outside the scope of the insurance`
        WHEN `Article 7(2)(a): an intentional act of the injured person` THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE                                                         JUST `an exclusion of Article 7(2) applies, other than the injured person's own intentional act`

-- The amount for the harm, once a case holds (fork V6).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 17(1)(a), first paragraph; fork V6
GIVEN harm IS A `The harm to the person`
      case IS A `A case of Article 17(1)(a)`
GIVETH A `Humanitarian support under Article 17(1)(a)`
`Article 17(1)(a) — the support for` harm `in the case` case MEANS
    CONSIDER harm
    WHEN `death` THEN `support of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit per person per accident, for health and life` TIMES 30%) case
    WHEN `an injury assessed at a rate of` rate THEN
        BRANCH IF rate AT LEAST 81 THEN `support of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit per person per accident, for health and life` TIMES 30%) case
               IF rate AT LEAST 31 THEN `support of` (`Article 6(1) — the limit per person per accident, for health and life` TIMES 10%) case
               OTHERWISE                `no support: an injury rate under 31%`

-- The answer for one person. The cases are tried vehicle by vehicle; the first case found is
-- reported (the amount does not depend on which).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 17(1)(a), first paragraph
GIVEN v      IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      person IS A `A person harmed in a road accident`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A defect in the facts given` `Humanitarian support under Article 17(1)(a)`
`Article 17(1)(a) — under` v `, the humanitarian support for` person MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
        IF   `the rate is out of range`
        THEN LEFT `an injury rate is not between 0 and 100`
        ELSE IF   null (person's `the vehicles that caused the harm`)
             THEN LEFT `no vehicle is named as having caused the harm`
             ELSE CONSIDER mapMaybe (GIVEN veh YIELD `Article 17(1)(a) — the case in which the harm is put by` veh) (person's `the vehicles that caused the harm`)
                  WHEN EMPTY THEN RIGHT `no support: none of the cases of Article 17(1)(a)`
                  WHEN case FOLLOWED BY more THEN RIGHT (`Article 17(1)(a) — the support for` (person's `the harm`) `in the case` case))
    WHERE
        `the rate is out of range` MEANS
            CONSIDER person's `the harm`
            WHEN `death` THEN FALSE
            WHEN `an injury assessed at a rate of` rate THEN rate LESS THAN 0 OR rate GREATER THAN 100

-- The same answer for an accident on a given day, in the vintage then in force (fork V1); an
-- accident before 6 September 2023 is declined by name.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 17(1)(a), Article 77(1); Decree 220/2026 Article 10(1)
GIVEN person IS A `A person harmed in a road accident`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A defect in the facts given` `Humanitarian support under Article 17(1)(a)`
`Article 17(1)(a) — the humanitarian support, in the vintage in force on the day of the accident, for` person MEANS
    `Article 17(1)(a) — under` (`the vintage in force on` (person's `the accident happened on`)) `, the humanitarian support for` person

