GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the Fund's Management Council's process, procedure and file for humanitarian support and for repaying advances (Article 20(1)(k)) are not in the sources of this model` MEANS
    REFUSE "the Fund's Management Council's process, procedure and file for humanitarian support and for repaying advances (Article 20(1)(k)) are not in the sources of this model"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 20(1)(k)
GIVEN person IS A `A person harmed in a road accident`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Article 17(1)(a) — who receives the support, and the file to submit, for` person MEANS
    `the Fund's Management Council's process, procedure and file for humanitarian support and for repaying advances (Article 20(1)(k)) are not in the sources of this model`

§§ `Article 17(1)(a), second paragraph — repaying an insurer's advance`

-- Article 12(3)(b), which this paragraph names, repeated from row VN-10 under this row's names:
-- where the accident has NOT yet been found within the scope of compensation, the insurer
-- advances 30% of the limit per person for a death or an estimated injury rate of 81% or more,
-- 10% for an estimated rate from 31% to under 81% (fork V6 again).
