-- src:504 | điểm b khoản 3 Điều 12 Nghị định này, Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới có trách nhiệm
-- src:505 | hoàn trả số tiền mà doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm đã tạm ứng bồi thường trong trường
-- src:506 | hợp tai nạn được xác định thuộc loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm hoặc không thuộc
-- src:507 | phạm vi bảo hiểm.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 17(1)(a), second paragraph; fork V11
GIVEN v       IS A `A vintage of the decree`
      advance IS AN `An advance an insurer paid`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A defect in the facts given` `The Fund's duty to repay an advance`
`Article 17(1)(a) — under` v `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` advance MEANS
    `the answer in` v `, unamended by Decree 220/2026:` (
        IF   advance's `the amount advanced` LESS THAN 0
        THEN LEFT `an amount is negative`
        ELSE CONSIDER advance's `the point under which it was paid`
             WHEN `point (a): the accident had been found within the scope of compensation` THEN
                 RIGHT `no duty: the advance was paid under point (a) of Article 12(3)`
             WHEN `point (b): the accident had not yet been found within the scope of compensation` THEN
                 IF   advance's `what was later found of the accident` EQUALS `within the scope and not excluded`
                 THEN RIGHT `no duty: the accident was later found within the scope and not excluded`
                 ELSE RIGHT (`the Fund must repay` (min (advance's `the amount advanced`) (`Article 12(3)(b) — the advance for` (advance's `the harm, as estimated when the advance was paid`)))))

§§ `Article 17(1)(a)-(h) — the ceilings on the Fund's spending`

-- Each head may spend at most a percentage of "tổng số tiền đóng vào Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- hàng năm" (the total paid into the Fund in the year); for (a), (b) and (c) the base adds "số
-- dư Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới các năm trước (nếu có)" (the balance of earlier years, if any).
-- The figures were checked on the gazette page images (gazette pages 16-18, PDF pages 15-17):
-- 30, 15, 17, 10, 5, 10, 5, 8. They add up to 100, on two bases (NOTES.md §5.3).
-- Fork V12: "số tiền đóng vào Quỹ" (the money paid into the Fund) is read as the insurers'
--   contributions of the year (Article 15(1), Article 16); interest, sponsorship and other
--   receipts (Article 15(2)-(4)) are not "đóng" (paid in as a contribution) and reach spending
--   only through the balance of later years.
