§§ `Article 17(1)(i) — an emergency`

-- Where the Prime Minister has declared an emergency of natural disaster, or announced an
-- epidemic of a group A infectious disease, the Council MAY use the balance of earlier years
-- for points (d), (đ), (e), (g) and (h), in total no more than those points' rates
-- "tương ứng với mức đóng góp tối đa 1%" (corresponding to the maximum contribution of 1%).
-- Fork V13: the total ceiling is the sum of the rates of (d) to (h), taken of what the
--   contributions would be at 1% of the premiums on which they are computed; the rates are read
--   from the table above, not retyped.
